        "abstract": "Parametrized Cauer ladder network equations are derived for the reduced representation of the nonlinear eddy-current field. The variation of basis functions of the magnetic field is included in the network equation for accurate tracing of the parameter transition with respect to the magnetic saturation degree. Several reasonable formulations are proposed using the reluctivity and differential reluctivity, where the variation of the basis functions does not need to be explicitly calculated.",
